WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.550
Aha made absolute fools of us all.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.700
The curse of Elation still has me

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.950
pinned firmly to this chessboard.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:16.750
Pre-dating the birth of Aeons and the era of the primordial nouspores,

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.125
leviathans were already entrenched at the absolute beginning.

00:00:21.775 --> 00:00:24.175
Seems like everything's in place.

00:00:27.475 --> 00:00:33.400
At this moment, "Preservation" and "Imagenesis" have finally merged into a single theme.

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.525
What is the most surefire way

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:40.025
to destroy an unfinished painting once and for all?

00:00:41.075 --> 00:00:46.250
I did it. All of it.

00:00:46.775 --> 00:00:49.875
The masses revere these monstrosities as heroes,

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.975
place their faith in them, worship them...

00:00:52.975 --> 00:00:54.925
I come to appraise.

00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:57.966
I come to analyze.

00:00:57.966 --> 00:01:01.100
Haven't had such a hearty meal in a long time.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.658
I come to render.

00:01:02.775 --> 00:01:04.975
...Brings back memories.

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:08.800
I weave the cosmos into brocade.

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:10.733
Breathe soul into painted stones,

00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:12.633
let the jewels of heaven rise as they will.

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:17.050
Hear that?

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:19.450
The referee is in place,

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:23.100
and it's time for the Supplicants to make their entrance.

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:26.033
All eyes across the cosmos will be fixed on

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:30.458
Ahatopia to witness this god-slaying game.

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:36.100
And today, we set sail once more!

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:39.300
To deceive! To bait!

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:42.125
To slay! The awakened... Oroboros!

00:01:42.875 --> 00:01:45.200
Please enjoy

00:01:45.275 --> 00:01:49.500
this end-of-the-century magic trick, co-starring gods and mortals alike!

